WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Foldrobe: File Organizer. A quick tour of every core feature.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Add a folder. Tap Choose a folder once. Foldrobe indexes it and refreshes file changes.

00:08.000 --> 00:11.000
Browse your places. Open selected folders or refresh them manually.

00:11.000 --> 00:14.800
Search quickly by filename, type, or location. Try presets for large videos and old downloads.

00:14.800 --> 00:17.400
Refine results by type, location, size, and age. Switch between list and gallery.

00:17.400 --> 00:20.400
Rooms group videos, images, documents, archives, and audio by file type.

00:20.400 --> 00:24.400
Review storage analytics to spot large, old, and possible duplicate files.

00:24.400 --> 00:32.700
Bulk deletion. Enter a filename, review matching results, and confirm before deletion.

00:32.700 --> 00:40.200
Manage several files. Select files to copy, move, cut, paste, or rename.

00:40.200 --> 00:45.200
Private by design. No account, ads, tracking, or developer cloud.

00:45.200 --> 00:48.200
Your files, finally in order. Foldrobe is available on the App Store.
